# ── ApplicantOS runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────
var/
!var/.gitkeep
# Anchored to the repo root: unanchored `storage/`, `cache/` and `screenshots/` also matched
# the `app/storage/` and `app/cache/` source packages and `docs/screenshots/` — the captures
# README embeds — so new files in any of them were silently ignored by `git add`. The runtime
# directories they are meant to catch all live under `var/` (see `settings.storage_root` /
# `settings.cache_path` / `settings.screenshot_dir`) and stay ignored.
/storage/
/screenshots/
traces/
browser-profile/
*.har
*.trace.zip
/cache/
.applicantos/

# Generated documents — never commit someone's resume
*.pdf
*.docx
!docs/**/*.pdf
!desktop/src/assets/**
generated/
tailored/

